### Page 5 of 16

```text
UDC-23-00049
May 1, 2023
RECOMMENDED MOTION:

Move to approve the Stadium View, 4th Filing Expedited Preliminary Plat, advancing the Final Plat to the
Governing Body, with a recommended exception to block size.

APPLICABLE CITY CODE SECTION(S) AND PLANS:

UDC 2.1.2 Preliminary Plat Approval

UDC 2.1.3 Final Plat Approval

UDC Article 4 Subdivisions

UDC Article 5 Zoning Regulations

PlanCheyenne

BACKGROUND:

The applicant is requesting approval of a plat create 3 residential lots. One lot will be for the existing house,
and the two new lots will allow future residential development.

SURROUNDING LAND USE AND ZONING:

ANALYSIS OF APPLICATION CONFORMANCE WITH REVIEW CRITERIA:

Should the Planning Commission wish to recommend approval of the Preliminary Plat, the Commission
must make the following findings required in UDC 2.1.2.d  a detailed analysis is below:

1) The application is in accordance with the development policies and physical patterns
identified in the Comprehensive Plan. (UDC 2.1.2.d.1)

The future land use map within PlanCheyenne identifies this area as developing with a mix of
residential uses, and the proposed plat in the existing zoning district would be compatible with
this objective. PlanCheyenne supports the use of existing infrastructure and timely provision of
services (including emergency and education services). This development is proposed in an area
which has largely existing infrastructure. The property is within the Urban Service Boundary and
has access to all utilities.

The Future Land Use Designation for this property and the surrounding area is Urban
Residential. The Urban Residential designation is intended to allow for a mix of residential uses,
but does not encourage changing existing, stable neighborhoods. The surrounding
neighborhood appears largely stable, but it does contain a few locations with 2 units on one lot.

